  "repairs": [
    "Shared ServiceModeDiscovery separates bounded serialized mode observation from accepted group candidates. Native and adapter refresh groups while mode RPCs stall, retaining previously accepted facts on errors.",
    "Mode-change notifications cancel obsolete group lookup candidates and refresh the provider in both clients; adapter route caching checks the candidate mode snapshot. Actual Cluster mode ownership is preserved for externally constructed native clients.",
    "Failed mode checks coalesce a notification to the independent membership loop in both clients. Background membership refresh does not recursively poll mode and reschedule itself. Existing channels, runtime, cancellation and joined shutdown remain shared."
  ],
